              </?01M05F1PF55QM1055E9KDQF0DA>
            ]>
          )>
          <Task { id = "T1.3" name = "正式收集 runtime extension hooks 字段" status = "DONE" order = 2 priority = "P0" } (
            <Description ?01M05F1PF55QM1055E9KDQF0DB>
            在 AI runtime extension contract 上暴露 hooks contribution 字段，并由 composer 在 extension apply 后按 overlay 顺序归并到 assembly hookDefinitions。
